    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University Institute for Human Development (IHD) is conducting a study that targets adolescents in Kenya. Funded by Templeton World Charity Foundation, the project aims to evaluate the character development of adolescents as well as how connected they feel towards society.",
